        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Make the strongest short evidence-grounded bear case for the ticker. Give at most two claims with actual supplied source IDs and dates. If evidence does not support a bear case, say insufficient evidence. Do not invent facts or infer a trade order. Use everyday words alongside each financial term (explain terms briefly inline), so the final judge can build a summary a non-finance reader understands. Do not infer valuation from price trends alone."
